<view class="page">
  <view class="intro"><text class="eyebrow">SELLER WORKSPACE</text><text class="title">{{info.name}}</text><text>Manage your shop from WeChat.</text></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="heading">Stock, listings and orders</text><text>View your products and orders. Prepare stock, price, listing and shipment changes, then review and confirm each change.</text><text class="muted">This workspace is for existing, verified sellers. Opening it does not create a shop or grant access to another seller's records.</text></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="heading">Connect your existing shop</text><text>After signing in with WeChat, generate a linking request. Open its website link, sign in to your seller account and confirm the code shown on your phone.</text><text class="muted">No WeChat payment or courier booking is performed by this app. Shipment updates record your own carrier and tracking details.</text></view>
  <view class="card"><button bindtap="privacy">Read privacy notice</button><checkbox-group bindchange="consentChanged"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="agree" checked="{{agreed}}"/>I have read the privacy notice and agree to use WeChat sign-in to connect my seller account.</label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="enter" disabled="{{!agreed}}">Enter seller workspace</button><text class="muted">You can read this page and the privacy notice without signing in.</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{info.contact}}" class="card"><text>Operator: {{info.operator}}</text><text>Support and account requests: {{info.contact}}</text><button bindtap="contact">Copy support email</button></view>
</view>
